    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《海上钢琴师》这部电影讲述了一个钢琴天才的传奇一生。他的能力足以打败爵士乐的发明者，但他却从未踏上过陆地一步。1900 的故事从大海开始，以音乐贯穿始终，最终沉入海底。这部美丽的电影除了令人感动之外，也让人有所感悟。将它再次重刷的时候常有不同的解读和收获。</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 聊天的人 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>米周，「</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f12cea66d766074271629af?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlNjNiYmZmYjNjNWJjYTVmNjJkYzAyZiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f12cea66d766074271629af?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlNjNiYmZmYjNjNWJjYTVmNjJkYzAyZiJ9"><span>Why for Jazz</span></a><span>」主播</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 本期曲单 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>Opening - Morricone - </span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=5027088" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=5027088"><span>A Mozart Reincarnated</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Ending - Benny Goodman - </span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=5027096" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=5027096"><span>Playing Love (Piano Version)</span></a></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 参考资料 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>电影 《</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1292001/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1292001/"><span>海上钢琴师</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/23405963" data-url="https://www.zhihu.com/question/23405963"><span>海上钢琴师中杰里罗莫顿的原型是什么?</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.toutiao.com/article/6733378054699090436/" data-url="https://www.toutiao.com/article/6733378054699090436/"><span>《海上钢琴师》：看法国存在主义文学如何探寻人心、揭秘时代矛盾</span></a></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 制作团队 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：B</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音设计：邵旻</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目运营：小米粒</span></p><span></span><p><span>视觉设计：Jessi、齐寒</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 本节目由 JustPod 出品 ©2022上海斛律网络科技有限公司 -</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 互动方式 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博:&nbsp;</span>